From 5448105c880111c532b0d83839be0a7842321f71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 01:39:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] research: c2/partner - star cover, partner sets by depth,
 d-pair with a 12-number top root

dpair2 (research driver): sampled cost of the both-diagonals search on
V_{d1,d2} with the rarest of the 12 numbers of d1 and d2 as the top label
(roots only through it), against the plain root, and an exactness check
(--check K: random disjoint traversal pairs of every square of a sum must
find it; 400 tests on 11 bench sums, all found, square counts equal to the
plain root). research/wip/c2-partner: star-cover cost shares (star.py),
partner candidate sets by depth (partner.py), the d-pair ladder and the
cost per expected magic square.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GSaYLGdzq6d82nBLeSZFgB
